          "article_summary_tr": "Çalışma İstatistikleri Bürosu, geniş çalışma ekonomisi ve istatistik alanında Federal Hükümet için temel araştırma kuruluşudur. Eylül ayında 7,5 milyon olan iş ilanlarının sayısı çok az değişti. İşe alımlar ve toplam ayrılıklar sırasıyla 5,4 milyon ve 5,3 milyonda çok az değişti. İşten çıkarmalar 3,4 milyona yükselirken, işten çıkarmalar ve işten çıkarmalar 1,6 milyonda çok az değişti.",
          "article_context_tr": "QUERY LENGTH LIMIT EXCEEDED. MAX ALLOWED QUERY : 500 CHARS Üretici Fiyat Endeksi - Nihai Talep: Eylül 2026 'da %+1,3 (p)",
          "article_summary_en": "The Bureau of Labor Statistics is the principal fact-finding agency for the Federal Government in the broad field of labor economics and statistics. The number of job openings was little changed at 7.5 million in September. Hires and total separations changed little at 5.4 million and 5.3 million, respectively. Quits increased to 3.4 million, while layoffs and discharges changed little at 1.6 million.",
          "article_context_en": "The Bureau of Labor Statistics is the principal fact-finding agency for the Federal Government in the broad field of labor economics and statistics. An official website of the United States government Here is how you know The .gov means it's official. Federal government websites often end in .gov or .mil. Before sharing sensitive information, make sure you're on a federal government site. The https:// ensures that you are connecting to the official website and that any information you provide is encrypted and transmitted securely. The number of job openings was little changed at 7.5 million in September. Hires and total separations changed little at 5.4 million and 5.3 million, respectively. Quits increased to 3.4 million, while layoffs and discharges changed little at 1.6 million. BLS offers many types of data for regions, states and local areas. To browse for available information, make a selection from the tabs or use the economic news release finder below. Producer Price Index - Final Demand: +1.3%(p) in Sep 2026",
